  "scope": "Experimental member-policy unified two-tree record pool, same leaf hash/rules/escrow/mint source restrictions, per-record boolean tree selector, both registry roots authenticated, shared canopy per tree. Original source-record pools replaced with one tagged record table and one tagged subject table. Subject capacities unchanged. Smaller record capacities support fewer distinct(tree,record) entries; no claim of same worst-case diversity at lower budget.",
